        "TileImage": "$($repository 4f790c6b-95ff-4bb1-bcf5-41969e57f0ec).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning, 47. Your targets today are scientist Derek McInnis and several members of his team connected to Kronstandt&apos;s PALLAS project. All have voiced ethical concerns regarding the android&apos;s AI capabilities.\r\rThe targets can be located in and around Kronstandt&apos;s android lab in Miami. Curiously, the contract was issued from a computer within the lab itself. Furthermore, the anonymous client has requested that nothing is witnessed by the building&apos;s smart security system.\r\rHappy hunting.",
